{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117496","id":3407301790,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LF0ye","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117496","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117496.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117496.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117496","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117496/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117496/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117496/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a271501b59df7994b757fd332a0698b8101123bf","number":117496,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `Skeleton3D` editor gizmos when using modifiers","user":{"login":"Y-o-p","id":33079174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDc5MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33079174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p","html_url":"https://github.com/Y-o-p","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #117350\r\n\r\n**Summary of changes**\r\n* Keeping track of additional state in Skeleton3D for post-modified bone transforms\r\n* Exposing that state as getter functions `get_bone_global_pose_final()` and `get_bone_pose_final()`\r\n* Updated `skeleton_3d_editor_plugin.cpp` to use new getter functions\r\n\r\n**Technical overview**\r\nThere is brief window where the post-modified transform are available [here](https://github.com/Y-o-p/godot/blob/e961aadd6b3a135fbbdfc29c61f8440be7d914ae/scene/3d/skeleton_3d.cpp#L362), but then those transforms get reset back to their original pose. That was causing the gizmo to fetch the original pose data. I'm storing the post-modified transforms separately. Another potential fix is to somehow fetch the data from the rendering server?\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"709\" height=\"642\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b62861-7682-49da-8c0e-85513096cc41\" />\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"914\" height=\"545\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fb4e1ee-8f36-4d34-b06d-8166dd0f01ca\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","ti